#. ja: 碧のタマミズの細身のコウジン族は、軽やかな動きのお客人に教えを請いたいようだ。
#. de: Der hagere Kojin möchte dich um Rat bitten.
#. fr: Le Kojin maigrichon veut vous demander des conseils.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/026/StmBdz221_02693:TEXT_STMBDZ221_02693_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "The slender Kojin is looking for a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> who is light on <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> feet."
msgstr "Стройный кодзин ищет проворного <if $gn4>путника<else>путника</if>."

#. ja: 細身のコウジン族と話す
#. de: Mit dem hageren Kojin sprechen
#. fr: Parler au Kojin maigrichon
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/026/StmBdz221_02693:TEXT_STMBDZ221_02693_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Speak with the slender Kojin."
msgstr "Поговорите со стройным кодзином."

#. ja: 印に向かう
#. de: Zum markierten Felsen springen
#. fr: Atteindre le cercle lumineux
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/026/StmBdz221_02693:TEXT_STMBDZ221_02693_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Jump to the first plateau."
msgstr "Прыгните на первую площадку."

#. ja: 印に再度向かう
#. de: Zum nächsten markierten Felsen springen
#. fr: Atteindre l'autre cercle lumineux
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/026/StmBdz221_02693:TEXT_STMBDZ221_02693_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "Jump to the second plateau."
msgstr "Прыгните на вторую площадку."

